Sculptor
========

Sculptor is an interactive creative world editor for Minecraft 1.7.10 (GT New
Horizons): brushes with live preview, an in-game editor panel, and a cinematic
camera.

It is not a port of, and contains no code from, any all-rights-reserved mod. It
is an independent implementation built on the components listed below.


Relationship to WorldEdit
-------------------------

Sculptor is an addon to WorldEdit, not a replacement for it, and no longer
contains a copy of it. WorldEdit supplies the edit engine -- EditSession,
selections, masks, patterns -- and keeps all of its own commands and workflows.
Sculptor adds an interactive layer beside them, registers no `//` commands other
than its own `//sc-undo` and `//sc-redo`, and keeps its edit history separate
from WorldEdit's.

